# Build settings Vite reads in every mode; a .env.local beside it overrides them.
# The file store the short links (/s/<name>) point into — see README,
# "Opening a file from a link". None by default: Banana Scan has no store of
# its own, and a short link says so. Put VITE_FILES_URL=https://files.example.com/
# in a .env.local to give a build one.
